              <lg xml:id="m-907f32a8-dff3-47af-8b70-7d8fa450cb02">
                <l xml:id="m-dfec3236-5bb0-4c42-85bd-52d4e5d22267" facs="#m-422eb371-4653-4345-b538-f22aa395a2e6" label="ambiguous">Tuesday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-72a12224-30b3-40fc-a058-3b4684e2c681" facs="#m-32ecdf10-ebdf-448b-87f8-ffd7d82881ed" label="ambiguous">en</l><l xml:id="m-1509cc32-6644-43db-a17a-9945bda07419" facs="#m-bde0be1a-7944-4d4b-8411-576117437325" label="lyrics-like">V. Jú-di-ca, Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-0cae1167-4d24-4b8e-97d5-5ed5cb21c05c" facs="#m-c227cd78-7af7-4d84-b1c1-2fb0701ea734" label="lyrics-like">no-céntes me,</l><l xml:id="m-be01ef6d-bb76-4c0a-a663-f15a6202031d" facs="#m-53189c32-b476-41a2-aaaa-8942dab8f3de" label="ambiguous">ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a7ed971-a173-4fc0-8201-d3b21fda7513" facs="#m-db521360-b0b9-46f6-83ab-095fd4a3d768" label="lyrics-like">impugnán¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb0e5a13-6b39-4160-837f-016bf7c992a8" facs="#m-772cc116-b4ad-4dce-bfe2-4b5fb69e3ef6" label="lyrics-like">pú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0be8e16a-20cb-4f40-800a-23b3602bd186" facs="#m-6237209a-0b13-4c33-80c0-c8ee648c68c8" label="ambiguous">gna</l><l xml:id="m-a16d1ea5-99cd-459b-b73d-2ebf04a6d72c" facs="#m-eddfd3c3-6e45-41aa-b1e0-5f40cab7c745" label="ambiguous">tes me:</l><l xml:id="m-2e5f0c57-f1f7-4c8b-b854-4407c62ceaca" facs="#m-ce527d46-f1c4-4093-b55b-9cd86242ccc8" label="lyrics-like">apprehénde.</l><l xml:id="m-edd506a5-7271-4dcc-9a0c-045dc0c5c8c2" facs="#m-b7280cb9-6ef3-423b-be8f-c5c1768aaa8c" label="lyrics-like">et scú¬</l><l xml:id="m-63748ffa-fd34-429c-8a64-1a97bd17eead" facs="#m-beaba5c4-92fe-4d17-ae57-75bd56d24a89" label="lyrics-like">ár-ma</l><l xml:id="m-81c9afd8-a09e-4288-a17b-da463d42488a" facs="#m-f17de3ba-9850-429e-bc2f-edbfcd33560e" label="ambiguous">tum,</l><l xml:id="m-89ee3aa8-afa2-4c24-8cbf-fda7bb047a1d" facs="#m-0f2a8979-c08b-41b8-979d-0529a3051a32" label="ambiguous">et ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-04d0f5cb-5b00-4e0c-889a-e2a44efa8be1" facs="#m-468b3248-b955-4f5f-9a21-a2779f9df063" label="lyrics-like">in ad-jutó¬ ri-um</l><l xml:id="m-70b9315e-8b1a-4c41-bae7-cf85aae21b3a" facs="#m-50dc1beb-3e3e-4475-9142-5beb23d0d477" label="lyrics-like">súr¬</l><l xml:id="m-a6ed9cdb-720a-480e-8c80-1d938a260d5c" facs="#m-ed00e1e9-9978-48a9-9bc9-bc8a54852372" label="ambiguous">ge</l><l xml:id="m-63da545a-5698-4aea-a357-6e60bb981e95" facs="#m-0ed6fed8-ef33-4513-bfe7-c3ce2b8a35ee" label="ambiguous">hi.</l><l xml:id="m-ec0e65b5-c909-457f-b0c7-587fd75a1ae0" facs="#m-ee9a088a-265f-4e61-a324-7594222e043c" label="lyrics-like">mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ac8dfab-c5c6-4e8c-98b6-711ffc090b51" facs="#m-b478631b-3c95-45c2-8121-a0ce46e3b35d" label="text-like">The Gospel of the passion and death of Our Lord accordinɇ to St Marh. 14,</l><l xml:id="m-271270df-2b6e-4628-98a9-cbfae2bb2453" facs="#m-e83c40ac-8b86-4798-abd6-017bd732bbc1" label="ambiguous">32-72★15, 1-46.</l><l xml:id="m-ee508274-7764-4cfa-8f13-a694dcd3f724" facs="#m-b62febb4-11ed-47c1-a33d-0561d2dedc36" label="lyrics-like">Munda cor meum, Jube, domne (Dómine), benedicere and Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-12d38be9-4505-4a09-916a-6e851753ed4b" facs="#m-d5075666-4fcc-4dbe-8085-0f4ef6b31d2c" label="lyrics-like">sit in córdibus vestris (in corde meo) ae said; everything else as on the</l><l xml:id="m-12abcdc4-e4c8-464f-9e5d-b9251bc6f2c4" facs="#m-4582c011-6851-4910-ba9c-6d2209950dd4" label="text-like">Second Sunday of the Passion, p. 598.</l><l xml:id="m-46d26ce5-a884-4161-b135-ab4fa1d8deaf" facs="#m-35fd8edb-e4e3-412f-8d53-90d751087b86" label="ambiguous">Passio Domini nostri Iesu Christi secundum Marcum</l><l xml:id="m-ee6ea69e-3172-4bfd-b49b-85ab4815d81e" facs="#m-dd935f47-edcb-44cc-b693-5297109e7552" label="lyrics-like">IN illo témpore: Jesus et disci-invénit cos dormiéntes. Et ait</l><l xml:id="m-8127a1bf-8e8b-4225-a2c4-3563811a161d" facs="#m-25dcdc8b-24ad-48d3-83ce-bca5e1b39130" label="ambiguous">Petro: † Simon, dormis? non</l><l xml:id="m-7c896057-a62b-482c-93e7-55a8f2cc7067" facs="#m-f3b4f0f2-32b2-48f9-8b8f-40c04bca0620" label="lyrics-like">L puli ejus véniunt in praédium,</l><l xml:id="m-0b55b9c0-5090-4c45-bc47-3716c8f39f7d" facs="#m-82f26e56-6c87-4532-b314-894bc8d433ee" label="lyrics-like">botuisti una hora vigiláre? Vigi¬</l><l xml:id="m-71088d6f-bca7-4a24-87a9-97af99511a04" facs="#m-69d76c61-8e99-431b-b5ec-c29610b6dcc4" label="lyrics-like">cui nomen Gethsémani. Et ait</l><l xml:id="m-eed97a76-0516-4a0e-b5b5-93f30e02608e" facs="#m-11b4a465-0d53-4537-81fb-6b8f32195c8d" label="lyrics-like">láte, et orá̂te, ut non intrétis</l><l xml:id="m-f41316b5-5779-4a24-b693-7a9780351856" facs="#m-d037f6ba-fae6-496e-97c9-258e7638f5f1" label="lyrics-like">discipulis suis:  Sedéte hic</l><l xml:id="m-82c28604-8a33-4ffb-8d3c-059f97ee375a" facs="#m-396dcee6-754b-4309-b7b3-715da980f60e" label="lyrics-like">in tentatiónem. Spiritus quidem</l><l xml:id="m-739b9083-032d-4efa-ba47-431839008896" facs="#m-08696773-4384-4284-8396-64f2e19a9c4a" label="lyrics-like">donec orem. C. Et assúmit Pe¬</l><l xml:id="m-ddf25ee1-adc2-4fcb-8a45-8f8f23954967" facs="#m-7b28576d-54bb-4408-b197-6be097bff234" label="lyrics-like">promptus est, caro vero infírma.</l><l xml:id="m-a4c27eaa-8eeb-4a7f-8064-0d5f8a542c91" facs="#m-1c6c8414-7e81-4425-a5f2-90187ea12036" label="lyrics-like">trum, et Jacóbum, et Joánnem</l><l xml:id="m-a44dabce-6dfe-44d9-a79b-4de17642a7a4" facs="#m-be1898d8-6c2e-4f5b-a3ce-7e27348a5af3" label="lyrics-like">C. Et iterum ábiens orávit,</l><l xml:id="m-68d86efa-a801-4e9e-bdce-e5444cc4e694" facs="#m-19d3f3b7-0b66-44f6-9800-d6f5016c2c20" label="lyrics-like">secum: et cœpit pavére, et</l><l xml:id="m-279d8187-a9c3-4797-8143-562415e00393" facs="#m-0877fbc4-0de3-4abc-b32f-d2e163fee109" label="lyrics-like">eúmdem sermónem dicens. Et</l><l xml:id="m-b2205e84-6c4f-49bc-bd94-d00ddd08154f" facs="#m-5ac51875-fa4d-47a6-8e5d-aa81c37e1b8e" label="lyrics-like">tædére. Et ait illis: ★ Tristis</l><l xml:id="m-b1feb009-8ee2-41f1-a0fb-9e6e2f5208ae" facs="#m-0251cb02-98a3-47fb-a624-df2c00782e6c" label="lyrics-like">revérsus, dénuo invénit eos dor¬</l><l xml:id="m-637490ab-c1a4-44de-93cb-9d9ff26f8072" facs="#m-20e2e306-f9d0-4be8-b159-b71714ec3498" label="lyrics-like">est ánima mea usque ad mor¬</l><l xml:id="m-638f38c3-0124-43c1-b4dd-2f15c4b276c3" facs="#m-f553b30d-db99-4aee-a875-2a40db825406" label="lyrics-like">miéntes (erant enim óculi eórum</l><l xml:id="m-9d3bc8c9-00f3-4aac-906e-b156287b004f" facs="#m-e9deeadb-67f2-4aa1-bd88-0808f709b3be" label="lyrics-like">tem: sustinéte hic, et vigilâte.</l><l xml:id="m-0cfd31c8-7fd4-47a8-84f1-669786cf3ee3" facs="#m-ba063fae-6b6d-43e4-8b98-41dcdc0d3e1d" label="lyrics-like">graváti) et ignorábant quid</l><l xml:id="m-bdf4cbde-327c-4c9c-83f6-0872bcaf2251" facs="#m-a59c0039-90db-44ab-abf8-1dcebc840e4b" label="lyrics-like">C. Et cum processisset páulu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4671e61a-3769-4829-b2a7-db6133192cb1" facs="#m-32681cd2-03d8-4c9a-92aa-2cd7e88cf1ca" label="lyrics-like">respondérent ei- Et venit tértio,</l><l xml:id="m-f2f50fe7-a86f-45fe-bb70-34724111ba84" facs="#m-db126c05-c4d8-45a7-a60a-527b095ad72a" label="lyrics-like">lum, prócidit super terram: et</l><l xml:id="m-ec4ad35b-71d5-41d2-9886-d4ad9847c9c2" facs="#m-540f6f1c-b9b2-4604-becc-72b9df71cb13" label="ambiguous">et ait illis: 4 Dormite jam,</l><l xml:id="m-0f6aa49e-b6a4-475f-99bf-e3d82ca85643" facs="#m-9e311295-da62-4aaf-81ae-c709e254fb20" label="lyrics-like">orábat, ut si fieri posset, trans¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e00ec45-637e-4dd0-a175-582834dd0c1c" facs="#m-73fb8d52-2521-4283-bf6e-9860856d3903" label="lyrics-like">et requiéscite. Súfficit: venit</l><l xml:id="m-2423a332-d313-4523-94dc-3f1b644a5543" facs="#m-3243f3d7-b6c7-447c-89eb-7674e911269c" label="ambiguous">iret ab eo hora: et dixit: 4</l><l xml:id="m-e1db8f50-ebc7-4cdd-a372-084037b1825f" facs="#m-99b521ac-6418-4e10-9c68-34e0118e2dd8" label="lyrics-like">hora: ecce Filius hóminis tra¬</l><l xml:id="m-e382d635-8712-4ddf-86e0-29718ee69708" facs="#m-a6f8c79e-2ebf-4a19-ad3f-dda7b7952b1a" label="lyrics-like">Abba. Pater, ómnia tibi possi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1318ddeb-674e-43bf-96cb-fac2bac8e1ea" facs="#m-2dc93598-e322-4cda-a8b1-c311a214929d" label="lyrics-like">bilia sunt, transfer cálicem hunc</l><l xml:id="m-3f8eb613-69b6-4878-a308-a694cb39da1f" facs="#m-2043ed66-6e61-4ed8-870d-50d9872f4514" label="lyrics-like">détur in manus peccatórum.</l><l xml:id="m-7fee8b76-0c64-48c3-9efb-0448235d28d7" facs="#m-54706284-4b02-49e4-b647-4a52a0c1c1f6" label="lyrics-like">súrgite, eámus: ecce qui me</l><l xml:id="m-8dba92d3-0383-460c-8eaa-94437b6c1570" facs="#m-36da0bdb-560b-4213-a4c9-48dd153299d2" label="ambiguous">a me: sed non quod ego volo,</l><l xml:id="m-9e38f51d-4fe7-4a25-a568-2730711e1254" facs="#m-177e7043-969a-4f92-aa28-4b54dda72b9c" label="ambiguous">sed quod tu. C. Et venit, et! tradet, prope est. C. Et, adhuc</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>